armSNES-pico patch to upstream armSNES (libretro/libretro.c), GPL-2.0-or-later like the file it changes.
Copyright (c) 2026 TheGammaSqueeze. Applied by build.sh to a copy in out/src.

With ARMSNES_HOST_NO_HD the port makes no HD Mode 7 and no widescreen picture: the LK shows a
picture up to the console's hires size (512 x 478), and the two pictures' buffers (9 MB) do not
fit the 8 MiB core slot. Both options read Off whatever is set, and the buffers are a pixel each.

--- a/libretro/libretro.c
+++ b/libretro/libretro.c
@@ -214,12 +214,22 @@
